  manager: {fileID: 1238563033}
  shortComment: "What is this\u2026?"
  diaryEntry: "His conduct is entirely unlike him,  I must determine whether he has
    come to harm. Perhaps the horse fled and he pursued it into the woods\u2014but
    such a notion cannot account for the scraps of fabric and\u2026 skin\u2026 I
    have found upon the ground. A wolf, perhaps. A rogue beast. I cannot say, yet
    I shall continue my inquiry."
  alreadyReadComment: I've already looked at this.
  sequenceManager: {fileID: 1558855496}
  advanceDelay: 4
  blockingCollider: {fileID: 2050592905}
